  id: sir_john_barbirolli
  category: bandas musicales
  difficulty: 1
  answer: Sir John Barbirolli
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Sir John Barbirolli
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABViolin Concerto in D major Op. 35 (2006
    - Remaster): I. Allegro moderato\xBB, de 1935, y llega hasta 2004."
  - "\xABMadama Butterfly, Act I: Questa \xE8 la cameriera (Goro, Pinkerton, Suzuki,
    Sharpless)\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a 94 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABElgar: Variations on an Original Theme, Op.
    36 \"Enigma\": Variation IX. Adagio \"Nimrod\"\xBB y \xABMadama Butterfly, Act
    I: E soffitto, e pareti (Pinkerton, Goro)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABElgar: Cello Concerto in E Minor, Op. 85: I. Adagio
    - Moderato\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABCello Concerto in E Minor, Op.85 (1988
    Digital Remaster): I. Adagio - Moderato\xBB y \xABMadama Butterfly, Act II: Un
    bel d\xEC vedremo (Butterfly)\xBB."
